  How you'll open your Apps
  Choose how phones, TVs and laptops will open your Apps. Home network needs nothing to set up.
  You can change this later in Settings, under Access.

  > ○ Home network (default)
    ● Easy names at home
    ○ From anywhere, privately
    ○ Your own web address
    ○ Bring your own
    ○ This computer only

  Phones, TVs and laptops on the same Wi-Fi or router as this computer can open your Apps at
  192.168.1.20. Nobody on the internet can.

  phones · TVs · laptops ──── router ──── this computer 192.168.1.20
